      "title": "Futuristic Solutions Limited Appoints Navneet Singh as Key Managerial Personnel, Effective January 9, 2026",
      "body": "Futuristic Solutions Limited has appointed Mr. Navneet Singh as Key Managerial Personnel of the Company with effect from January 9, 2026. Mr. Navneet Singh is a graduate from Delhi University. He has been a Managing Director of a tourism resort located within a Wildlife Tiger Sanctuary, where he saw accounting, financial planning, and operational management. He is also a Director of Amit Buildtech Private Limited. The appointment was based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee and approved by the Board of Directors in its meeting held on January 9, 2026.",
